## PainLocator vendor pin (runtime)

Vendored runtime files in this directory:

| File | Role | Three.js revision |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `three.module.min.js` | Runtime Three.js ESM (`REVISION` / build id **170**) | **r170** / npm `three@0.170.0` |
| `GLTFLoader.js` | Runtime GLTF/GLB loader (ESM; resolves `three` via import map) | **r170** companion from `three@0.170.0` examples |

**Runtime source of truth:** these vendored files (loaded only when Spatial mode is
selected). Do **not** add `three` as an application runtime dependency.

**Build-time only:** `three@0.170.0` is a **devDependency** so
`scripts/generate-exterior-glb.mjs` can regenerate the interim exterior GLB via
`GLTFExporter` on a clean checkout. Keep the npm pin aligned with this vendor
revision (r170).


